summary:
  With nothing playing the bridge sends a single space as the title, so the
  desktop's media controller draws a blank line.

history:
  Since the first release the title and album fell back to " " when the
  widget had neither a track nor a station. Read over the bus on the test rig
  on 2026-09-23 while stopped: xesam:title ' ' and xesam:album ' '. A name
  that is not there is now left out of the metadata.

target:
  package/contents/ui/mpris.py

find:
      title = str(state.get("title") or state.get("station") or "")

replace:
      title = str(state.get("title") or state.get("station") or " ")

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_mpris_metadata.py::test_nothing_on_shows_nothing.
  Line-neutral.
